              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "JHN.19.37"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Yoh 19.37",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "REV.1.7"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Ibyah 1.7",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " “Kandi nzasuka ku nzu ya Dawidi no ku baturage b'i Yerusalemu umutima w'imbabazi n'uwo kwinginga. Bazitegereza jyewe uwo bacumise, bazamuborogera nk'uko umuntu aborogera umwana we w'ikinege, bazamuririra bashavure, nk'uko umuntu agirira umwana we w'imfura ishavu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEC.12.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEC.12.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "MAT.24.30"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Mat 24.30",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "REV.1.7"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Ibyah 1.7",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEC.12.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEC.12.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ZEC 12:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Uwo munsi i Yerusalemu bazaboroga cyane, nk'uko baborogeye i Hadadirimoni mu kibaya cy'i Megido. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEC.12.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEC.12.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ZEC 12:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kandi igihugu kizaboroga, umuryango wose ukwawo, umuryango w'inzu ya Dawidi ukwawo n'abagore babo ukwabo, n'umuryango w'inzu ya Natani ukwawo n'abagore babo ukwabo, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEC.12.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEC.12.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ZEC 12:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "n'umuryango w'inzu ya Lewi ukwawo n'abagore babo ukwabo, n'umuryango w'Abashimeyi ukwawo n'abagore babo ukwabo, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEC.12.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEC.12.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ZEC 12:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "n'imiryango isigaye yose, umuryango wose ukwawo n'abagore babo ukwabo.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEC.12.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEC.12.14"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
